      "content": "What you're describing sounds like a profound and isolating crisis, and it's understandable why you feel completely adrift when your support systems seem to have vanished. When the outside world feels like it's actively rejecting you, the idea of trying to \"belong\" becomes exhausting and futile. Instead of focusing on forcing yourself to fit into a world that is currently rejecting you, perhaps focusing on finding small, private ways to nurture yourself might be a starting point. Please consider speaking with a therapist who can help you navigate these intense feelings of rejection and build a sense of self-worth independent of external validation.",
